CEAE1\">证明：过点 A 作直线 DE ∥ BC。</text>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"408\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#ECEAE1\">∵ DE ∥ BC，</text>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"464\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#F2D67A\">∴ ∠1 = ∠B，∠2 = ∠C</text>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"520\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#F2D67A\">　（两直线平行，内错角相等）</text>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"576\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#A9CFE6\">∵ ∠1 + ∠BAC + ∠2 = 180°（平角）</text>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"632\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ECEAE1\">∴ ∠B + ∠BAC + ∠C = 180°。</text>\n<path d=\"M1060.0,645.7 C1066.3,645.7 1085.2,645.4 1097.8,645.3 C1110.4,645.3 1123.0,645.6 1135.6,645.6 C1148.1,645.7 1160.7,645.6 1173.3,645.7 C1185.9,645.9 1198.5,646.7 1211.1,646.6 C1223.7,646.5 1236.3,645.4 1248.9,645.3 C1261.5,645.2 1274.1,645.9 1286.7,645.9 C1299.3,645.9 1311.9,645.2 1324.4,645.3 C1337.0,645.4 1349.6,646.6 1362.2,646.7 C1374.8,646.8 1393.7,646.0 1400.0,645.8\" stroke=\"#F2D67A\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"760\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ECEAE1\" opacity=\"0.85\">本图量得：∠B ≈ 60°，∠C ≈ 45°，∠BAC ≈ 75°</text>\n<text x=\"1060\" y=\"800\" font-family=\"'Noto Sans CJK SC', sans-serif\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ECEAE1\" opacity=\"0.85\">辅助线把三个角“搬”到了点 A 处的一条直线上。</text>\n</g>\n</svg>"
